files changed by patches/0001-add-optional-ai-hook.patch
---------------------------------------------------------

  csvkit/cli.py
      + hook in CSVKitUtility.run() that delegates to csvai.integration.run()
        only when --ai was passed
      + CSVKitUtility.ai_capable class attribute (default False)
      + CSVKitUtility._add_ai_arguments(), which registers the --ai flag group
        only if `import csvai.integration` succeeds

  csvkit/utilities/csvcut.py
      + ai_capable = True                     (1 line)

  csvkit/utilities/csvgrep.py
      + ai_capable = True                     (1 line)

Total: 40 added lines, 0 removed lines. No upstream logic is modified; with no
csvai installed and no --ai flag, both files behave exactly as upstream.

Upstream licence text is reproduced in LICENSE.upstream for reference.
